    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisirwor Daudi Solomon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eapuunete ŋirwa ŋulu iridakinia Daudi, Kisirwor Daudi lokoku keŋ Solomon tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aapuu ayoŋ anyoun anakwap ana lopite ŋolo enyoununuyoto ŋituŋa daadaŋ. Togogoŋ, totitiny ka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiwuap ŋuna ikicik Ekapolon Akuj kon, tolosi alorotin keŋ ka kiwuap ŋikisila keŋ, ŋakiciketa keŋ ka ŋuna etubunit iŋes ka ŋakiteyenikineta keŋ, lopite ŋolo igiritere Lokisila a Moses, ikotere nai irereŋier iyoŋ anakiro a daadaŋ a ŋuna itiyae iyoŋ ka aneni daadaŋ ilosi iyoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen nai isiyookinio Akuj akirot keŋ ŋina abu ekeik ayoŋ ebala, ‘Ani kiyok ŋiletok kon epite ŋolo eyaryata, toyarete eketopoloorito ayoŋ erae ŋulu ikinyoma alotai kec a daadaŋ ka anakiyar kec a daadaŋ, nyikipiyori iyoŋ aryamun ekile ŋolo iboikin lokicoloŋ kipuka Ŋisirael.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nabo daŋ iyeni iyoŋ ŋakiro ŋuna abu Yoab lokoku Aseruya kitiya neni kaŋ, epite ŋolo abunio iŋes kisicania ŋikarikok ŋuluarei, ŋulu a ajore a Ŋisirael. Ikes Abiner lokoku a Ner ka Amasa lokoku a Yeser, ŋulu abu iŋes toar. Abu iŋes tobuko ŋoakot kec ŋirwa ŋulu esilitere, aŋuna ka akinyaŋia ŋoakot ŋuna aris kebukor apaki ŋina ajiere ido abu kitereŋ a ŋaokot a ŋun arokoba ŋina anapit iŋes anacir ka ŋamuk ŋuna anapit iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai tokona, kitiya neni keŋ lopite ŋolo iyenia iyoŋ, nai nyimyek Yoab tonukae a ekisil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitoodiu arimao kon neni a ŋisapa a Barisilai a ŋolo alo Gilead, kimyek ikes toruwor ŋipei a ŋulu imujete ka iyoŋ alomesa kon, anerae apotu ikes ekesiryamut ayoŋ apaki ŋina aemitor neni alokaato kon Abusalom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toyenu daŋ atemar irukito iyoŋ ka Simei lokoku a Gera a ŋolo ebunit alo Baurim, alokabila a Benjamin. Abu iŋes ekelam ayoŋ neni aronon nooi akoloŋit ŋina arotokinio ayoŋ Manaim; nai akoloŋit ŋina atiyaunor iŋes akisiryam ayoŋ alo Yorodan, abu ayoŋ ekoŋ neni keŋ alokiro a Ekapolon otema, ‘Nyakaari ayoŋ iyoŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, nyimyek iŋes esibit nyesecit, Irae iyoŋ ekile ŋolo ios, iyenuni iyoŋ ŋuna kitiyakina neni keŋ. Emaikina iŋes tonukae iredito ŋoakot akou keŋ ŋina aŋakorwo nin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totwana nai Daudi iwapei ata papaa keŋ tonukae akuwan keŋ lotaun a Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Daudi kipuka Isirael ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon kipuka iŋes Isirael alo Eburon ŋikaru ŋikankarei ka alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋatomoniuni ka ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Solomon kilunyokin lokicoloŋ a papa keŋ a Daudi, ido abu toyeu apukan keŋ kitogogoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kitogogoŋ Solomon apukan keŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, bu Adoniya lokoku ka Agis bu neni a Basiseba atoto a Solomon. Kigit iŋes Basiseba tema “Isilit iyoŋ ibunit a?” Toboŋok Adoniya tema “Ee esilit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toropak irworo tema, “Tocamakinae ayoŋ erworikinos ka iyoŋ.” Toboŋok Basiseba tema, “Tolimu ŋuna eya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Adoniya, “Iyeni roboca iyoŋ atemar arae sek apukan ŋina kaŋ, ido ayenete Ŋisirael daadaŋ atemar ayoŋ aruwor ekepukan, tokona, nyeriŋa apukan erae ŋina kaŋ, nai aruwor ŋina alokaato kaŋ. erae Ekapolon abu kituruwo apukan ŋina alokaato kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai tokona, eyai akirot apei ŋina acamit ayoŋ akiŋit iyoŋ, nyikiŋer ca ayoŋ.” Tema Basiseba neni ka Adoniya, “Tolimu ŋuna eya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Adoniya, “Okoe, kiŋit kareca erwosit Solomon okoinak ayoŋ Abisag ŋina erae Asunamit toruwor aberu kaŋ, anerae ayeni ayoŋ atemar nyeŋeri Solomon ŋuna iŋisi iyoŋ iŋes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok Basiseba iŋes tema, “Ejok nooi; eŋisi ayoŋ erwosit ŋun aŋuna kon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Basiseba tolot neni a erwosit Solomon akirworikin ka iŋes aŋuna ka Adoniya. Tonyou erwosit kisiryam Basiseba, kijuuru itopoloorit toto keŋ, ido kitayau ituŋanan ekicoloŋ ŋolo iboikin toto keŋ, kiboikin nai toto a erwosit teten erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Basiseba, “Eyai ayoŋ akirot ŋina euruwuana ŋina acamit akigit iyoŋ, nyiwou ca.” Tema erwosit neni keŋ, “Kiŋit ŋuna icamit toto, anerae nyawouni ayoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Basiseba, “Kimyek Abisag ŋina erae asunamit toruwor aberu ka Adoniya alokaato kon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok erwosit Solomon toto keŋ tema, “Kaanukiro iŋitar iyoŋ Abisag ŋina erae Asunamit toruwor aberu ka Adoniya? Nyo bo nyiŋitar aŋuna keŋ apukan daŋ? Anerae erae iŋes lokaato kaŋ ŋolokiyae; nyiŋit ŋun aŋuna keŋ bon nai kiŋit daŋ aŋuna ka Abiasar a esacaradoti ka aŋuna a Yoab alokoku Aseruya a ŋulu eriitotor iŋes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikoŋ nai erwosit Solomon alokiro a Ekapolon tema, “Elipi kitiya Akuj neni kaŋ erono nooi tari kerae apaki ŋina aoyan, erae pa ketwana Adoniya aŋuna a ŋakiro a ŋuna iŋita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ŋakiro nai a ŋun, alokiro a Ekapolon a ŋolo eyari jik, a ŋolo ekewuaak ayoŋ aruwor erwosit elunyokin lokicoloŋ a papa kaŋ a Daudi, alokiro keŋ a ŋolo ewuaak apukan nakan kaŋ ikwapei aris kiikinia, emaikina Adoniya torae nakoloŋit na!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu erwosit Solomon kiyakiya Benaia lokoku a Yekoiyada; tolot Benaia, kicum Adoniya toar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
