              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema erwosit neni ka Abiasar a esacaradoti, “Ape Anasos kai kon ŋina alomanikor kon, anerae emaikina iyoŋ totwan. Nai nyakaari ayoŋ iyoŋ apaki na, anerae ibu iyoŋ toryoŋ alokiŋaren papa kaŋ Daudi Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet a Ekapolon a Akuj, ibu daŋ kidaŋidaŋ ŋican daadaŋ ŋulu abu papa kaŋ kidaŋidaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun abu Solomon tolema Abiasar anaraakau esacaradoti a Ekapolon. Kisiyook iŋes akirot ŋina aris Ekapolon kelimu alo Silo aŋuna ke ekal a Eli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edolunete ŋakiro ŋun neni a Yoab a ŋolo sek ariito ka Adoniya, tari daŋ ŋina sek pa ariitotor ka Abusalom, abu Yoab tolot loeema a Ekapolon, kikam ŋamomwar a Namuroet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elimokinio erwosit Solomon atemar alot Yoab loeema a Ekapolon ka iboi tokona alodiyete Namuroet, kiyakiya Solomon Benaia lokoku a Yokoiyada tema, “Ape, kicum iŋes toar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Benaia tolot loeema a Ekapolon tema neni a Yoab, “Ebala erwosit iyoŋ, ‘Tolomu kiŋa.’ ” Nai abu iŋes toboŋok tema, “Mam, toarakinae ayoŋ ne.” Toboŋo nai Benaia neni a erwosit tema, “Ŋuna akaboŋoki ayoŋ Yoab ikes ŋun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai erwosit Benaia tema, “Kitiya ŋuna ebala iŋes. Kicum iŋes toar, ido tonuk, ikotere nai elemari asecit aneni kaŋ ka alokal a papa kaŋ ŋina kebunio Yoab toarya ŋituŋa ŋulu pa asecito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyaŋari Ekapolon aneni a Yoab ŋaokot a ŋituŋa a ŋulu abu iŋes toar, anerae abu pa eyeni papa kaŋ Daudi kitiji ŋikilyok ŋiarei, toar ikes ka atum. Arae ŋuluarei ŋul Abiner lokoku Ner ŋolo arae ekarikon ka ajore anatutubet a ŋina anyaritae Isirael ka arae ŋoloce Amasa lokoku a Yeser ŋolo arae ekarikon ajore a atutubet a ŋina anyaritae Yudaya. Arae ŋuluarei ŋul ŋikilyok ŋulu ajokak ŋulu eyookino akilo Yoab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elipi ayoŋ min asecit ŋina abukorere ŋaokot kec nakou a Yoab ka ŋiletok keŋ ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. Nai neni a Daudi ka ŋiletok keŋ ka ekal keŋ ta apukan keŋ, elipi min ekisil a Ekapolon ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Benaia lokoku a Yekoiyada tolot kicum Yoab toar, tonukae kai keŋ a elope nariet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitopoloo nai erwosit Benaia lokoku a Yekoiyada kilunyokin lorot a Yoab aruwor ekarikon ajore. Kilunyok erwosit esacaradoti Sadok neni ka Abiasar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya nai erwosit ituŋanan anyarare Simei, tema erwosit neni a Simei, “Todukok akai kon Yerusalem, ido kiboi a nen. Nyinyou a nen tolot nakibois ace daadaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae akoloŋit ŋina inyounio iyoŋ a nen todok ayonae Kidiron itemokino iyoŋ toyenu atemar itwani, eruwor atwanare kon nakou kon a elope.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Semei neni ka erwosit, “Ejokak ŋakiro ŋuna ilimu iyoŋ; ikwapei ilimunio iyoŋ ekapolon kaŋ erwosit, etiyae ayoŋ eketiyan kon ŋun.” Aŋun, abu Semei kiboi alo Yerusalem ŋirwa ŋulu alalak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋiuni, apotu ŋipi a Semei ŋiarei toema neni a erwosit Akis lokoku a Maka a ŋolo alo Gas. Ani elimokinio Semei atemar eyakasi ŋipi keŋ Gas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu iŋes tonyou toenik esigirya, tolot akis nakwap ŋina a Gas akiwarit ŋipi keŋ. Tonyou Simei alo Yerusalem tolot Gas kinyaku ŋipi keŋ ai na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elimokinio Solomon atemar abu Simei tonyou alo Yerusalem alot Gas ka aboŋu daŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiyakiya erwosit ituŋanan anyarare Simei. Tema erwosit neni a Simei, “Pa ekesikoŋit ayoŋ iyoŋ alokiro ke Ekapolon a? Pa ekesileerekinit ayoŋ iyoŋ ebe, ‘Toyeni kire jik atemar akoloŋit ŋina inyounio iyoŋ a nen tolot nakibois ace daadaŋ, itwani iyoŋ a?’ Ibu iyoŋ itoboŋok ayoŋ tema, ‘Ejokak ŋakiro ŋuna ilimu iyoŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaanukiro nai pa iwuapya iyoŋ ŋuna ibu kikoŋ neni a Ekapolon ka akiciket ŋina abu ayoŋ ekecikak iyoŋ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema daŋ erwosit neni a Simei, “Iyeni iyoŋ alotau kon aronis daadaŋ ŋina ibu iyoŋ kitiya neni a papa kaŋ a Daudi; aŋun, ikitoboŋokini Ekapolon iyoŋ aronis kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai eketerereŋio ayoŋ erwosit, ido itogogoŋio apukan a Daudi ŋina erubakini ejok aneni a Ekapolon ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai erwosit Benaia lokoku a Yekoiyada alosit akiar Simei, ido abu tolot kicum Simei toar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
